## Program Outcome

Tool Shed continuously discovers, records, explains, and reports unclosed or unhealthy outcome
loops as bounded source-specific findings. Operators can copy a stable Tool Shed command from the
hosted dashboard, paste it into the matching local chat, and safely continue or reconcile the loop
through existing authority and evidence controls. Historical ambiguity remains supervised and no
hosted execution channel exists.

